    {
      "id": "spies_1",
      "cite": "Numbers 13:17–19",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "spies_1_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Go up and see what the land is like. Are the people strong or weak? Is the land good or bad? Are the towns unwalled or fortified?",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "moses",
          "align": "left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "spies_2",
      "cite": "Numbers 13:23",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "spies_2_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Twelve men went — one from each tribe. For forty days they explored the land. They came back carrying a single cluster of grapes so heavy that two men carried it on a pole.",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "spies_3",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Report: the land is ours to take 🌿",
          "note": "Two of the twelve say so. The rest say the opposite."
        },
        {
          "label": "Report: we cannot go up 🛡️",
          "note": "Ten of the twelve say so, and the fear spreads through the camp."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "spies_3_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "The twelve stood before the whole assembly. What would they say about what they had seen?",
          "position": "center",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "spies_4",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "spies_4_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "The land flows with milk and honey — but the people who live there are powerful, and the cities are fortified and very large!",
          "position": "middle-right",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "shake",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "right",
